    {
      "id": "4.47.4",
      "label": "4.47.4",
      "numbers": [
        4
      ],
      "devanagari": "विचिन्त्य दिवसम् सर्वे सीता अधिगमने धृताः |\nसमायान्ति स्म मेदिन्याम् निशा कालेषु वानराः",
      "iast": "vicintya divasam sarve sītā adhigamane dhṛtāḥ |\nsamāyānti sma medinyām niśā kāleṣu vānarāḥ",
      "translation": "All the Vanara-s firmed up in finding Seetha have searched nooks and corners of earth by day, and at nighttimes they used to come together onto earth at scheduled places.",
