    {
      "id": "4.47.9",
      "label": "4.47.9",
      "numbers": [
        9
      ],
      "devanagari": "सुषेणः पश्चिमाम् आशाम् विविच्य सह वानरैः |\nसमेत्य मासे पूर्णे तु सुग्रीवम् उपचक्रमे",
      "iast": "suṣeṇaḥ paścimām āśām vivicya saha vānaraiḥ |\nsametya māse pūrṇe tu sugrīvam upacakrame",
      "translation": "Sushena, the father-in-law of Sugreeva, searching whole of western quarter along with vanara-s, but not finding Seetha there, he came back when one month is completed, and approached Sugreeva.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "suSeNaH vaanaraiH saha",
