      ],
      "devanagari": "उदार सत्त्व अभिजनो हनूमान्\nस मैथिलीम् ज्ञास्यसि वानरेन्द्र |\nदिशम् तु याम् एव गता तु सीता\nताम् आस्थितो वायु सुतो हनूमान्",
      "iast": "udāra sattva abhijano hanūmān\nsa maithilīm jñāsyasi vānarendra |\ndiśam tu yām eva gatā tu sītā\ntām āsthito vāyu suto hanūmān",
      "translation": "\"Hanuma is high-born and exceptionally mighty, oh, Sugreeva, the king of vanara-s, he will ascertain about Maithili, because the son of Air-god, Hanuma, resorted to the direction in which Seetha is taken away.\" Thus, monkey chiefs reported to their king Sugreeva.",
